<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44854" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρέπ-εια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>goodly appearance,
			comeliness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρεπείᾳ προέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.31
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρέπεια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				274b
			</span></i>, al.; <i>majesty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τῆς δόξης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Je.</u>
					23.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Jac.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>; <i>dignity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				880.19
			</span></i> (Pizus, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστεφάνωσε ἁ πόλις . . -είας καὶ
					εὐνοίας ἕνεκα τᾶς ἐς τὰν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.1418
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>speciousness, plausibility</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρεπείᾳ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.11
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				82
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχει . . εὐπρέπειαν μᾶλλον ἢ
					ἀλήθειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					305e
				</span></i>
			; <i>pretext</i>, c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
